{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《聲夢傳奇》出身的文凱婷（Aeren），最近在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中迎來演技新突破！今次她飾演女主角之一張曦雯（Kelly）的年輕版，不僅顛覆了過往深入民心的乖乖女形象，劇中更與吳偉豪上演親密戲份，絕對是一次大突破。</p><p></p><p>日前，文凱婷在劇集宣傳活動的後台，成功向張曦雯及張智霖（Chilam）「集郵」合照。她隨後分享相片並開心留言：「穿越時空去見長大後的璀璨家庭！」瞬間化身成小粉絲。雖然 Aeren 這次在劇中未有機會與兩位前輩同場上演對手戲，但她表示能夠參與劇集拍攝已經感到非常開心。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"72d6019f-5c6c-4c58-8358-36da8cd3bdf0.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qmHeug50Fi1792637610.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>對於文凱婷的驚喜演出，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區送上鼓勵及讚賞，表示：「Aeren 演得好自然，造型好靚」、「期待未來有更多劇集演出，繼續加油！」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"09628b0f-b6ca-4521-8eb2-caa57cb8a4c2.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026cuSlI1lfsc1792637609.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"b87103e4-5dab-4ad8-91c9-a0d8c9d7358c.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260GYXtAg1ts1792637608.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.771191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:37:51.379324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:58.120998+00:00","content_hash":"25bcb511d571571c8e135aea53bee97a84cddeaedb68f1b988da776d2a10e3ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}